  "title": "刚刚！OpenAI 确认下一代模型 Astra 存在：仅花 2000 美金狂解 10 大数学前沿难题",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MTkxMjYzOA==&mid=2247516618&idx=1&sn=babfc57c2f90138cbcd1530f12863686",
  "date": "2026-08-01 17:52:00",
